# 2026-10-21 (RESULTS §7): no --avg_logp (beta=0.1 is the papers' value for *summed* log-probs; with per-token means it pushed
# the bad span ~30 nats/token and wrecked the model), and --ref init (reference = the S1' adapter the arm starts from; with the
# base model as reference the bad spans are already ~7 nats/token below it at step 0 and the loss is saturated).
# 2026-10-22: micro-batch 1 x accum 32 (same effective batch): the DPO step holds two policy graphs + two reference forwards on
# v2 pairs with long public prefixes and OOMed at micro-batch 2 (job 11835829, 35 GB + 4.3 GB).
--objective dpo
--beta 0.1
--lam 0.3
--sft_files data/sft/v2/sft_train.jsonl
--pair_files data/sft/v2/pairs_train.jsonl
--val_files data/sft/v2/sft_val.jsonl
--init_adapter outputs/train/sft_v2/adapter
--max_steps 300
--lr 5e-5
--sft_mix 0.5
--micro_batch 1
--accum 32
--grad_ckpt
--cache_dir data/cache
--ref init
